    "detailed_description": "ATTENTION PICKPOCKET<br>An engaging game of strategy and stealth that thrusts you into a world where you must choose a side: will you be a cunning thief or a brave volunteer? Your choice will determine your objective and how you interact with your surroundings.<br><br>Game Modes<br>1. Thief: (Currently the only game mode)<br><br>Objectives:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steal as many items as possible before getting caught.<br></li><li>Deliver items to hideouts to convert them into money.<br></li><li>Other objectives may be implemented in future updates.</li></ul><br>Game Mechanics:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully plan your moves, choosing the right moment to act.<br></li><li>Watch out for the eyes of other passengers and cameras.<br></li><li>Other mechanics may be implemented in future updates.</li></ul><br>ATTENTION PICKPOCKET is a dynamic game, constantly enriched with updates that modify gameplay and introduce new maps and scenarios. Each update will bring new challenges and opportunities for both thieves and volunteers, ensuring a fresh and stimulating gaming experience.<br><br><strong>Future Map Updates</strong>: Discover new Subway station designed by the community.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Changes:</strong> Expect new mechanics and tools to improve your stealth or surveillance skills.<br><br><strong>Special Events</strong>: Participate in time-limited events with unique rules and special rewards, hoping that the CIGGIEL doesn't send us a letter too!",
    "about_the_game": "ATTENTION PICKPOCKET<br>An engaging game of strategy and stealth that thrusts you into a world where you must choose a side: will you be a cunning thief or a brave volunteer? Your choice will determine your objective and how you interact with your surroundings.<br><br>Game Modes<br>1. Thief: (Currently the only game mode)<br><br>Objectives:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steal as many items as possible before getting caught.<br></li><li>Deliver items to hideouts to convert them into money.<br></li><li>Other objectives may be implemented in future updates.</li></ul><br>Game Mechanics:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully plan your moves, choosing the right moment to act.<br></li><li>Watch out for the eyes of other passengers and cameras.<br></li><li>Other mechanics may be implemented in future updates.</li></ul><br>ATTENTION PICKPOCKET is a dynamic game, constantly enriched with updates that modify gameplay and introduce new maps and scenarios. Each update will bring new challenges and opportunities for both thieves and volunteers, ensuring a fresh and stimulating gaming experience.<br><br><strong>Future Map Updates</strong>: Discover new Subway station designed by the community.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Changes:</strong> Expect new mechanics and tools to improve your stealth or surveillance skills.<br><br><strong>Special Events</strong>: Participate in time-limited events with unique rules and special rewards, hoping that the CIGGIEL doesn't send us a letter too!",
